                "title": "Half Round Cabinet Knob | Deltana KRH114",
                "description": "Half Round Cabinet Knob Deltana KRH114 - This Half Round Cabinet Knob is decorative as well as functional. Each cabinet knob includes mounting hardware for easy installation. It brings a touch of classic hardware decor to any desk, cabinet door, furniture piece, or drawer. Solid brass construction allows for years of use. We offer 7 different finishes for this cabinet knob, but no matter which finish you choose, the handle will still be high quality solid brass. It has a 1-3/8 inch diameter and has a 1 inch projection.\r\n",
